From cdca7a89a1ad01f26bd29c1103dbbcae834c3604 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Miguel <kuboloko.info@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:53:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] feat(cotl): wire in Palin and Usha portraits, add
 supporting cast

- Add palin-majere.jpeg and Usha-DiThon.jpeg to the subsection's public
  image folder and reference them from characters.ts
- Palin's card now uses his portrait instead of the placeholder; one
  understated line added to his bio about a past connection at Wayreth
- New character Usha DiThon (Silver Robe mage, secondary/recurring cast),
  tied to Palin's arc without over-explaining
- characters.ts: extend `side` with "supporting" and export a SUPPORTING
  array, folded into ALL_CHARACTERS in display order
- personagens.tsx: new "Supporting Characters" section between the main
  heroes and the villains
- CharacterCard placeholder hint and the image doc-comment updated to
  the actual convention (files at the subsection root, .jpeg)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
